<title>SPAIN: Argentaria cuts prime rate to 7.0 pct.</title>
<headline>Argentaria cuts prime rate to 7.0 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Corporacion Bancaria de Espana (Argentaria) said on Tuesday it was cutting its prime lending rate to 7.0 percent from 7.25 percent.</p>
<p>This follows the 25 basis point reduction in the Bank of Spain's key money rate to 5.50 percent at this morning's repo auction.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
</text>
